en banne. yes you are, in fact i will say to toolbox when he will make the halloween banner to put you in there!','2024-08-06 11:48:10',0,0,0,0),(34,27,'1o4xy9i8h9fPwnerv1',3,'Plz give me admin (jk)','tixz iz ​​EtErNaL, boombux bad1111!1111\\r\\nZOMG HAX XDXDXD','2024-08-06 14:34:27',0,0,0,0),(35,3,'marsoc',3,'hi','hi','2024-08-06 14:35:08',0,0,0,0),(36,4,'toolboxia',3,'pepsi','pepsi','2024-08-07 19:08:49',0,0,0,0),(37,3,'marsoc',2,'updates 08/07/2024','hello george, i understand you are on vacation, so i will send you a message for every day you miss\\r\\n\\r\\ntodays sum of development\\r\\n- 3 more catalog items became onsale (pirate hat, stetson, and viking helm)\\r\\n- KOs and WOs now save from games that properly register them, KOs now show on profile\\r\\n- httpGet/httpPost now works\\r\\n\\r\\nmy concerns\\r\\n- users can go to the page that the httpGet points to and set their own arguments and have them point to the user database to update their own stats for free','2024-08-07 23:41:55',0,1,0,0),(38,3,'marsoc',4,'RE: pepsi','pepi','2024-08-08 18:47:35',0,0,0,0),(39,2,'george0001',3,'boomblox','hello marsoc i know that i am on a vacation rn but i am curious if you made any new updates on boomblox. i am on a windows 8.1 rn and i found out that i can message you from here.\\r\\n\\r\\nsee you soon.\\r\\n-george0001','2024-08-09 16:39:19',0,0,0,0),(40,3,'marsoc',2,'RE: boomblox','hi george\\r\\n\\r\\nwe have had some new things happen\\r\\non the games page it now shows how many people are online in a server\\r\\nserver lists arent a thing yet tho\\r\\ni took a break yesterday and recreated the 2005 client which was fun\\r\\ncurrently im working on making the player count on a game go back to 0 if a server is closed forcefully','2024-08-09 16:58:10',0,1,0,0),(41,3,'marsoc',2,'08/09/2024 updates','hey george today here is what i did\\r\\n\\r\\ngames now show how many players are playing them from Games.php\\r\\nItem.php (place item) now shows a server list under it, and if you join a server it adds you to the player in the serverlist','2024-08-09 23:26:39',0,1,0,0),(42,3,'marsoc',2,'updates','there was a site vulnerability, where people can just basically as if they were going to DDOS the site but just use a ddos software to refresh on a profile to spam profile views; you had around 3.5k views at one point lmao\\r\\n\\r\\nwe broke the player count record at 10','2024-08-10 19:34:05',0,1,0,0),(43,43,'John Doe',3,'READ!!','haha made u look ur gay hahahahahhaahhahahahahhahahahaha gay gay gay gay','2024-08-11 03:29:57',0,0,0,0),(44,2,'george0001',3,'Thanks','Good to Hear that we broke the Player record! Please keep informing me for when new stuff comes ouț!','2024-08-11 08:24:29',0,0,0,0),(45,3,'marsoc',43,'RE: READ!!','frik you','2024-08-11 12:12:59',0,0,0,0),(46,3,'marsoc',2,'some updates','i uploaded like a gazillion hats for ppl to wear (3 hats) but they think they r cool so its cool xd ','2024-08-11 18:13:45',0,1,0,0),(47,5,'HDROIDEV',3,'lord have mercy','we must stay focus brothers','2024-08-11 21:43:37',0,0,0,0),(48,2,'george0001',3,'1 day left...','1 day left before i am back again... anything new that i should know?\\r\\n','2024-08-13 05:45:46',0,0,0,0),(49,3,'marsoc',2,'RE: 1 day left...','no not really i mean i added a few more hats i added favoriting items and we accepted like 20 new testers xd some are probably copy nolan or yomi but thats up to the staff\\\'s judgement since they essentially filtered through them','2024-08-13 19:07:57',0,1,0,0),(50,3,'marsoc',47,'hi','you frikin stink.;.','2024-08-14 19:56:48',0,0,0,0),(51,57,'Pixel',58,'howdy','howdy epical!','2024-08-15 16:07:52',0,0,0,0),(52,27,'1o4xy9i8h9fPwnerv1',2,'fren or no fren?','Do you want to be my friend?','2024-08-15 17:27:50',0,1,0,0),(53,2,'george0001',62,'hello','hello :D','2024-08-16 08:14:53',0,0,0,0),(54,62,'Lynyrd.Skynyrd',2,'Hello','Hello |:}','2024-08-16 08:29:45',0,1,0,0),(55,27,'1o4xy9i8h9fPwnerv1',62,'welcome to bomblox!','Welcome to boom