ighbors!','2025-08-16 13:30:50',0,0,0,0),(2713,70,'tobu.fi',115,'RE: game question','Hey there! Good question. \r\n\r\nRoblox was kind of weird about \"client-sided\" stuff until like mid-2013. Before then, localscripts could act as a sort of mediator between the client and server without much effort. As an example, you could create a Vector3Value from inside a localscript that updates the position of your mouse to the object\'s value — and a regular script could naturally read its value without any issues; even though it should, by the nature of code law, not. \r\n\r\nThis is why a lot of old games broke around 2013, since it updated the behavior of localscripts to be truly \'local.\'\r\n\r\nBut before this update, there was one* exception to this client<->server behavior: \'CurrentCamera.\' This object can only be found in workspace if you reference it inside a localscript; as in a regular script, it doesn\'t exist — making it entirely local.\r\n\r\nAnd that behavior is exactly how you can make client-sided parts. \r\n\r\nThis can be done by parenting the parts you want to be client-sided inside CurrentCamera itself. This even includes regular scripts and non-part objects. The player that corresponds to this camera can both see and interact with these objects, but on other player\'s screens, they will not see anything — only the player, randomly floating or going to places where they seemingly shouldn\'t. \r\n\r\nReplication may be very weird, and you could still communicate these client-sided parts to the server through a variety of ways; but this was basically the method that people used to make them. These parts stay in the player\'s camera even after they respawn — so there\'s a LOT of things that you could do with this knowledge. \r\n\r\nAs an example of what you can do, I made a VIP door that relies on CurrentCamera to pass through the door. I uploaded the model onto Boomblox (https://bmblox.xyz/Item.aspx?ID=698), although since you can\'t actually grab the model I also uploaded it here: https://files.catbox.moe/u4x5pe.rbxm\r\n\r\nHave fun!\r\n\r\n*=Definitely not the only exception. Just go with it :P','2025-08-16 18:23:56',0,0,0,0),(2714,110,'SONIC32XMARS',86,'Friend Request','hello dear frozen administrator man would you accept my frend request?','2025-08-17 00:41:30',0,0,1,0),(2715,76,'pwnzor',3,'you have big forehead','lel','2025-08-17 12:09:57',0,0,0,0),(2716,3,'marsoc',76,'RE: you have big forehead','boi\r\n------------------------------\r\nOn 8/17/2025 at 12:09:57 PM pwnzor wrote lel','2025-08-17 15:02:18',0,0,0,0),(2717,70,'tobu.fi',66,'I HATE YOU','STOP MAKIGN VIDEOS','2025-08-17 22:26:41',1,0,0,0),(2718,101,'FileyDaFile',1,'dare!!','you will never respond >:D','2025-08-18 07:15:53',1,0,0,0),(2719,111,'gravityhq',60,'RE: RE: Friend Request','\r\n------------------------------\r\nOn 8/14/2025 at 05:38:25 PM tim wrote \r\n------------------------------\r\nOn 8/1/2025 at 11:09:42 AM gravityhq wrote \r\nso real.\r\nsup tim','2025-08-18 08:06:56',0,0,0,0),(2720,106,'Sporemex',76,'RE: MUAHAHAHAHAHA','wot','2025-08-20 14:27:12',0,0,0,0),(2721,76,'pwnzor',73,'HEY YOU','1V1 ME IN CHAINSAW RIGHT NOW!11!!11!1!1 https://bmblox.xyz/Item.aspx?ID=425','2025-08-23 10:45:16',0,0,0,0),(2722,3,'marsoc',51,'h','hello','2025-08-23 16:18:51',0,0,0,0),(2723,98,'AtoZenne',86,'RE: RE: RE: RE: Friend Request','On 5/1/2025 at 04:00:50 PM nox wrote bring back alphys\r\n------------------------------\r\nOn 5/1/2025 at 04:00:50 PM nox wrote bring back alphys','2025-08-23 16:32:47',0,0,0,0),(2724,98,'AtoZenne',3,'Friend Request','','2025-08-23 20:07:25',0,0,1,0),(2725,98,'AtoZenne',79,'Friend Request','','2025-08-23 20:07:29',0,0,1,0),(2726,98,'AtoZenne',76,'Friend Request','','2025-08-23 20:07:33',0,0,1,0),(2727,98,'AtoZenne',100,'Friend Request','','2025-08-23 20:07:37',0,0,1,0),(2728,98,'AtoZenne',93,'Friend Request','','2025-08-23 20:07:40',0,0,1,0),(2729,98,'AtoZenne',108,'Friend Request','','2025-08-23 20:07:44',0,0,1,0),(2730,98,'At